# THE ART MASTERS inbox (owner decree 2026-08-12) — the full-resolution
# research output every prompt writes into. It is NOT tracked; the
# BAKED, downscaled, WebP versions under shared/assets/ are, and those
# are the only art either platform reads. Anchored to the repo root so
# an assets subfolder named `masters` could never be swallowed.
# See desktop/setup/__about/make_art_bake.md.
#
# WHAT THIS MEANS FOR SAFETY, stated plainly because it matters: every
# master currently here is already in git HISTORY (it was committed
# under shared/assets/ before this round moved it out), so nothing is
# lost by untracking. But art added to masters/ FROM NOW ON exists only
# on the owner's disk until he backs it up. The repo protects the
# shipped tree; it no longer protects the masters.
/masters/

# The Star Wars reference stills (owner order 2026-08-14: they belong
# beside the prompts that use them, not in his personal inbox — moved
# out of UV/ into the sheet's own folder). Still NEVER committed: they
# are third-party film frames, and the sheet has always said so. Their
# `<- sw_reference/...` paths are now relative to the sheet itself.
shared/research/prompts/starwars/sw_reference/

# The metal transformer's verification output — contact sheets and
